<title>USA: Anicom says completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Anicom says completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anicom Inc said it completed a private placement of 1.2 million common shares for proceeds of $15.8 million before expenses.</p>
<p>Proceeds will go to acquisition opportunities and general corporate purposes, said the multimedia technology distributor.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
